<title>FRANCE: Euro Disney appoints new CFO.</title>
<headline>Euro Disney appoints new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euro Disney SCA, the operator of the Disneyland Paris theme park, said on Tuesday that Philippe Misteli, a Unilever executive, had been appointed senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Misteli had been Unilever's vice president of strategy worldwide since 1986 and previously held the position of chief financial officer of Quest, Unilever's cosmetics division in the Americas.</p>
<p>Euro Disney said in a statement that chairman Gilles Pelisson also appointed Laurence Berman-Clement as vice president of strategic planning and corporate alliances and Jean-Luc Chretien as vice president of distribution.</p>
<p>Euro Disney is 39 percent owned by The Walt Disney Co.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
